#: ../../api/termination.md:6
msgid "Termination"
msgstr "Termination"

#: ../../api/termination.md:14:<autosummary>:1
msgid ":py:obj:`saealib.Termination <saealib.Termination>`"
msgstr "{py:obj}`saealib.Termination <saealib.Termination>`・終了条件"

#: ../../api/termination.md:14:<autosummary>:1
msgid "Termination class to determine when to stop the optimization process."
msgstr "最適化処理をいつ停止するかを判定する終了条件クラスです。"

#: ../../api/termination.md:14:<autosummary>:1
msgid ":py:obj:`saealib.TerminationCondition <saealib.TerminationCondition>`"
msgstr "{py:obj}`saealib.TerminationCondition <saealib.TerminationCondition>`・終了条件"

#: ../../api/termination.md:14:<autosummary>:1
msgid "Composable termination condition."
msgstr "合成可能な終了条件です。"

#: of saealib.termination.max_fe:1
msgid "Create a termination condition based on maximum function evaluations."
msgstr "関数評価回数の上限に基づく終了条件を作成します。"

#: of saealib.termination.f_target saealib.termination.max_fe
#: saealib.termination.max_gen saealib.termination.stalled
msgid "Parameters"
msgstr "パラメータ"

#: of saealib.termination.max_fe:3
msgid "Maximum number of function evaluations."
msgstr "関数評価回数の最大値です。"

#: of saealib.termination.f_target saealib.termination.max_fe
#: saealib.termination.max_gen saealib.termination.stalled
msgid "Returns"
msgstr "返します"

#: of saealib.termination.max_fe:6
msgid "A composable condition that returns True when ``ctx.fe >= value``."
msgstr "``ctx.fe >= value``のときに真を返す合成可能な条件です。"

#: of saealib.termination.f_target saealib.termination.max_fe
#: saealib.termination.max_gen saealib.termination.stalled
msgid "Return type"
msgstr "戻り値の型"

#: of saealib.termination.f_target:17 saealib.termination.max_fe:10
#: saealib.termination.max_gen:10 saealib.termination.stalled:18
msgid "Examples"
msgstr "例"

#: of saealib.termination.max_gen:1
msgid "Create a termination condition based on maximum generations."
msgstr "世代数の上限に基づく終了条件を作成します。"

#: of saealib.termination.max_gen:3
msgid "Maximum number of generations."
msgstr "世代数の最大値です。"

#: of saealib.termination.max_gen:6
msgid "A composable condition that returns True when ``ctx.gen >= value``."
msgstr "``ctx.gen >= value``のときに真を返す合成可能な条件です。"

#: of saealib.termination.f_target:1
msgid "Create a termination condition based on a target objective value."
msgstr "目標目的値に基づく終了条件を作成します。"

#: of saealib.termination.f_target:3
msgid ""
"Intended for single-objective problems. The direction is taken from "
"``ctx.direction`` (``-1`` for minimization, ``+1`` for maximization), so "
"the condition is met when the best objective found reaches ``value`` from"
" the correct side (``best <= value`` when minimizing, ``best >= value`` "
"when maximizing). Returns ``False`` while the archive is empty."
msgstr ""
"単目的問題用です。方向は``ctx.direction``（最小化は``-1``、最大化は``+1``）から取り、最良目的値が正しい側から``value``に達したときに条件を満たします（最小化では``best"
" <= value``、最大化では``best >= value``）。アーカイブが空の間は``False``を返します。"

#: of saealib.termination.f_target:9
msgid "Target objective value."
msgstr "目標目的値です。"

#: of saealib.termination.f_target:12
msgid ""
"A composable condition that returns True when the best objective in the "
"archive reaches ``value``."
msgstr "アーカイブ内の最良目的値が``value``に達したときに真を返す合成可能な条件です。"

#: of saealib.termination.stalled:1
msgid "Create a termination condition based on lack of improvement (stagnation)."
msgstr "改善がない状態（停滞）に基づく終了条件を作成します。"

#: of saealib.termination.stalled:3
msgid ""
"Terminates when the best score (``f @ direction``, higher is better) has "
"not improved by more than ``tol`` for ``window`` consecutive generations."
" Improvement is tracked across calls using ``ctx.gen``; the returned "
"condition is therefore stateful and intended to be used once per run."
msgstr ""
"最良スコア（``f @ "
"direction``、高いほど良い）が``window``世代連続で``tol``を超えて改善しないと終了します。改善は``ctx.gen``を使って呼び出し間で追跡するため、返される条件は状態を持ち、1回の実行につき1度使う想定です。"

#: of saealib.termination.stalled:8
msgid "Number of generations without improvement before terminating."
msgstr "終了前に改善がない世代数です。"

#: of saealib.termination.stalled:10
msgid "Minimum score increase counted as an improvement, by default ``1e-8``."
msgstr "改善として数える最小スコア増加量です。既定値は``1e-8``です。"

#: of saealib.termination.stalled:13
msgid ""
"A composable condition that returns True after ``window`` stagnant "
"generations."
msgstr "``window``世代停滞した後に真を返す合成可能な条件です。"
